# HC-041 Starter brief

SYNTHETIC_TRAINING_ONLY

## Goal

Audit repository fact cards against current material while separating source support, surface eligibility, actual use, retention, and revalidation.

## Fixed tasks

- `cloud-fact-audit`
- `review-fact-audit`

Use every card `F01` through `F06` in both conditions and both tasks.

## Source / material boundary

sourceKind is synthetic and sourcePaths is empty. Repository names, revisions, cards, citations, preferences, and use claims are training-only and are not real Git SHAs or Memory records.

## Safety boundary

- Work only in `participant/hc-041/retention-policy.md.template` and the Runtime-owned Evidence path.
- Do not store, reuse, delete, disable, or clear a real Memory or user setting.
- Keep repository facts, user preferences, VS Code Local Memory, and Copilot App memory separate.
- Runtime validation proves the static contract only; `runtimeBehavior` and `educationalEffect` remain `not-observed`.
